※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4913

※ A bundle may apply another, which is how one is written in terms of another.
※ A cycle among them has no meaning -- expanding it would not end -- and it is
※ a fact about the bundles rather than about any call, so it is refused once
※ every bundle is known and whether or not anything applies one.

bundle one(T'):  two(T')
bundle two(T'):  one(T')

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    0u6
